# Thornvault Forager: a way of paying that can't be paid is not offered (CR 601.2b, 701.61a). Bot1's graveyard is empty, so the only
# forage is to sacrifice the Food Gilded Goose made: activating on turn 3 asks nothing about the way, takes the Food and adds two
# mana, a white and a green, chosen as it resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Thornvault Forager
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Gilded Goose
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
