Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Gilded Goose.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Graveyard = 
Bot1.Battlefield.Thornvault Forager.Activate(Ability: Forage)
Bot1.Colors(White; Green)
? Bot1.Graveyard = 
